  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The context",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Alan members could chat with health professionals, but many did not use it, or used it once."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The question",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Understand adoption and engagement",
            "Map the different use cases",
            "Make the chat a bridge between patients and their health professionals",
            "Make Alan a real health partner"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I did",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Member interviews",
            "Use-case mapping",
            "Journey analysis",
            "Workshops",
            "Iteration"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What we learned",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Alan Clinic bridged the gap between patients and their health professionals in some crisis situations.",
            "Members opened their health insurance app just to check if there was anything new or valuable.",
            "The most needed health professionals: dermatologists, sex therapists, psychologists, physiotherapists.",
            "People wanted to be guided, with some form of triage."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What changed",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "We added health professionals.",
            "We added a triage.",
            "We added visual cues and helpers to navigate.",
            "We asked the health professionals to check on each patient once."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I liked",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "quote",
          "text": "A real team effort: PM, researcher, designer, developers and doctors, all inside the team."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I’d change",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Interview the health professionals as much as the members."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
